。角色设计三视图和人头图，画面最左侧三分之二是左中右均等分布三视图，最右侧三分之一是人头图：\n画面最左侧三分之二\n1.左边版面：全身正视站姿（中性站姿，手臂自然下垂） \n2.中间版面：全身45°左侧视站姿（中性站姿）\n3.右边版面：全身90°左正侧视站姿（中性站姿）\n最右侧三分之一分成上下板面\n上板面是头部正视图\n下板面是头部45°左侧视图，三个视图动作统一，标准站姿，纯白色背景，无遮挡，完整展示全身造型，4K，超高清，线条清晰，造型统一，极致细节， 版式（单张合成图，干净网格，统一光影与色彩）全图各分区曝光与色彩一致，4K细节，超干净纯白底背景，脚下干净柔和投影。正面打光，人物全身光线均匀，五官立体。\n名字“柯莱特”使用极小的黑体字，在画面左上角，用圆角矩形线条框住。\n\n最后输出中文，只要答案，不要装饰表情，不要星号*\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 473], "pos": [0, 564], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextInput_"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [76], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "你是全能的智者，能回答我所有专业的问题，直接输出答案，不要有星号*", "Hello", 0, 186688888, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 68, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 71, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget"